Subject: [PATCH] expose some func kinds, remove local var creation for RaiseException
expose some value attributes
---
Index: src/stdx/chir/attribute.cj
IDEA additional info:
Subsystem: com.intellij.openapi.diff.impl.patch.CharsetEP
